      "text": "Allowed bots to send ephemeral replies to callback queries in any chat except channel direct messages chats by specifying callback_query_id without receiver_user_id in the parameter ephemeral_message_parameters of the methods sendMessage, sendRichMessage, sendAnimation, sendAudio, sendContact, sendDocument, sendLivePhoto, sendLocation, sendPhoto, sendSticker, sendVenue, sendVideo, sendVideoNote and sendVoice."
